msgctxt "96"
msgid ""
"(We're supposed to meet up in front of Smile Burger, right?\r\n"
"According to Chika, this is the place...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "Um, are you the guy who called me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Huh? What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Eh? Di che diavolo parli?"

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm sorry! I'm waiting for someone, I just thought you\r\n"
"were them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Wait a sec."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr "...Cosa?"

msgctxt "180"
msgid "You wouldn't happen to be from the telephone club, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Yes, actually... Oh, so you were the guy on the phone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Not quite. I'm not looking to be a customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "228"
msgid "By any chance, is your name Nami?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "W... Wait, whaaat!? How do you know my name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"I ran into your dad not too long ago. He's been looking\r\n"
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Huh!? Why is Dad looking for me in Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "You wait here, I'm gonna give him a call."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "No, please, don't!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "No complaining. Stay here for a moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "Salve?"

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Is this Nami's dad? It's me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Oh, it's you! Did you find her!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I found Nami. We're at Smile Burger on Nakamichi\r\n"
"Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Really!? Stay there! I'm on my way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Nami! You're okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr "Papà..."

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"Where the hell have you been, Nami!? I've been looking\r\n"
"everywhere for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Why're you so mad!? I just wanted to get away from home for\r\n"
"a while! You didn't have to chase me all the way here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"We're going home, right now! This is no place for you\r\n"
"to live!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Whoa, hey, it's Nami. What's up? You in some kinda trouble?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Oh... Yuto-kun..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Who the hell are you guys!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Who's this guy? One of your clients?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "No... Actually, he's⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Client? Like hell I am! I'm her father, dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Wait, you're her dad? For real? Dude, that's hilarious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Who are these rude young men, Nami? Tell me everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"Hah! We're Nami-chan's Tokyo buddies! Don't worry, ever\r\n"
"since she ran off to Tokyo, we've been takin' good care of\r\n"
"her. In more ways than one, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Taking care of her!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"That's right! We taught Nami-chan how to con those telephone\r\n"
"club losers out of their cash when she's not doin' so hot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"It only took a few days for us to turn Nami-chan into a\r\n"
"real adult woman!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "You little bastards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Hey, ow! What gives, old man!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"I'll deal with Nami later. First, I'm going to teach you\r\n"
"punks a lesson!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "The <Italic>fuck</Italic> you say to us!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"If you're gonna act like a mischievous punk, you'd better be\r\n"
"prepared to get treated like one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid ""
"Shut it, you old fuck! You really think you can beat us in\r\n"
"a fight!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"You ain't gonna make it outta this with all your bones\r\n"
"intact! Let's fuck 'em up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid ""
"Who the hell are these guys... They ain't human...\r\n"
"I can't believe we lost to a bunch of old farts..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "*pant* Like I'd ever lose... to half-baked punks like you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid ""
"Nami! When I'm done with you, you'll wish you never made\r\n"
"that stupid decision to run away from home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid ""
"What the hell, Dad!? This is the exactly why I left home\r\n"
"in the first place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid ""
"Why didn't you ever tell me anything, then!? Your mother\r\n"
"and I have been worried sick about you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "You left without a note or saying anything... Like a coward!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid ""
"Try and understand how your old man feels. There aren't\r\n"
"a lot of parents out there that care enough about their\r\n"
"kids to get this angry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid ""
"If you're unhappy about something, then we should talk\r\n"
"about it. After all, we're a family... aren't we, Nami?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "Daddy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid ""
"It's up to you whether or not you wanna live in Kamurocho.\r\n"
"But it's not easy for a woman to live in this town by\r\n"
"herself. You'll have to sacrifice a lot of comforts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid ""
"Unless you're prepared to make that sacrifice, you'll get\r\n"
"duped by idiots like them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "You got that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "Yeah, I get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid ""
"Let's go home, Nami. Your mother and I are going to\r\n"
"have a word with you when we get home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "1236"
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough. I'll never, ever forget what\r\n"
"you've done for our family!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid "Please, take this, as a token of my gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>100.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1272"
msgid "Again, thank you so much!"
msgstr "Di nuovo, grazie mille!"

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

